-**Our area is competitive; our accuracy is not** — 1.38× the field's LUT at 10.6
-points less accuracy on UNSW-NB15. Detail: [`BENCHMARKS.md`](BENCHMARKS.md) §4,
-positioning: [`COMPETITORS.md`](COMPETITORS.md) §5.
